---
import { site } from '../../config/site';
import OptimizedImage from '../site/OptimizedImage.astro';
import { IMAGE_WIDTHS } from '../../lib/images';
---

<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="content-width">
    <div class="content">
      <figure data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
        <OptimizedImage
          src={site.ourStoryImageUrl}
          alt="Woman representing the community supported by Anisa Foundation"
          width={590}
          height={590}
          widths={[...IMAGE_WIDTHS.half]}
          sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, min(590px, 47vw)"
          defaultWidth={800}
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </figure>
      <div class="text">
        <h2>Our <span>story</span></h2>
        <p>The Anisa Foundation is a project of the Anisa Kabir family.</p>
        <p>
          The foundation started as a small project—a way to give back as our
          family built <a href="https://pathedits.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Path</a>, a photo editing business with operations based in
          Gaibandha, Bangladesh.
        </p>
        <p>
          We began with a pledge to dedicate 5% of company revenue to charitable
          contributions, and have since put over $1,000,000 into our work in
          Gaibandha.
        </p>
        <p>
          In 2024 our dreams got even bigger. We formed the Anisa Foundation with
          a vision of a thriving Gaibandha where everyone has access to the
          resources they need for a good life.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
